### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080
@base = {{host}}/api/v1

### ============================================================
### CLIENTES - CRUD JPA
### ============================================================

### Listar clientes
GET {{base}}/clientes?page=0&size=10

### Crear cliente
POST {{base}}/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cedulaRuc": "1205559999",
  "nombres": "Ana Lucia Mendoza",
  "email": "amendoza@correo.ec",
  "telefono": "0991112233",
  "direccion": "Quevedo, Los Rios"
}

### Obtener cliente
GET {{base}}/clientes/1

### Actualizar cliente
PUT {{base}}/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cedulaRuc": "1205551234",
  "nombres": "Maria Fernanda Vera Loor",
  "email": "mfvera-nuevo@correo.ec",
  "telefono": "0987654321",
  "direccion": "Quevedo, Los Rios",
  "activo": true
}

### Eliminar cliente (soft delete)
DELETE {{base}}/clientes/1

### ============================================================
### PROVEEDORES - CRUD JPA
### ============================================================

### Listar proveedores
GET {{base}}/proveedores

### Crear proveedor
POST {{base}}/proveedores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ruc": "1791111111001",
  "razonSocial": "Tecnologia del Litoral S.A.",
  "email": "ventas@litoral.ec",
  "telefono": "042999888"
}

### ============================================================
### PRODUCTOS - CRUD JPA + operaciones via SP
### ============================================================

### Listar productos
GET {{base}}/productos

### Crear producto
POST {{base}}/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "P-005",
  "descripcion": "Auriculares Bluetooth con cancelacion de ruido",
  "precioUnitario": 95.00,
  "stock": 40,
  "proveedorId": 1
}

### FN05 - Validar stock disponible
GET {{base}}/productos/1/stock/validar?cantidad=5

### SP04 - Actualizar precios de proveedor (+10%)
PATCH {{base}}/productos/proveedor/1/precios?porcentaje=10

### ============================================================
### FACTURAS - lectura JPA + operaciones via SP
### ============================================================

### SP07 - Registrar factura completa (SP transaccional)
POST {{base}}/facturas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": 1,
  "detalles": [
    { "productoId": 1, "cantidad": 1 },
    { "productoId": 2, "cantidad": 3 },
    { "productoId": 3, "cantidad": 2 }
  ]
}

### SP01 - Obtener factura completa (cabecera + cliente + detalles)
GET {{base}}/facturas/1/completa

### FN02 - Total facturado a cliente en rango
GET {{base}}/facturas/cliente/1/total?desde=2026-01-01&hasta=2026-12-31

### Listar facturas
GET {{base}}/facturas

### Anular factura
DELETE {{base}}/facturas/1

### ============================================================
### REPORTES - via SP
### ============================================================

### SP03 - Ventas por producto en periodo
GET {{base}}/reportes/ventas/por-periodo?desde=2026-01-01&hasta=2026-12-31

### ============================================================
### SWAGGER / ACTUATOR
### ============================================================

### Swagger UI
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html

### Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
